-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1440847-dumb-idea-court-bargain-with-covid-19?p=1440987#post1440987\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also do you really want to pin your court to something that\u2019s going to start its permanent decline any month now?</div> </div> </div> </div>This would have been my first argument if/when the Court Bargain with Diseases thread in general, and it holds for pretty much any you'd pick up.<br /> <br /> It also leads towards the inevitable slope of &quot;Why not Bargain with Disease period?&quot; which leads to &quot;Why not Bargain with Death ala the Horsemen from First Edition Geist&quot;, which leads to &quot;Why not bargain with the major powers of the other gamelines?&quot; and that's all she wrote*.<br /> <br /> *The Curses, Luna, Supernal Entities/The Watchtowers/Exarchs, The Principle, The Judges, the God-Machine, the Dark Mother, etc, you already know, you've probably already thought about it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T04:55:08-07:00","id":1441486,"title":"","content":"Oak, Ash, And Thorn brings that very question up and also says: \u201cWell.. why not?\u201d To the possibility of making a Bargain with any of those entities. I wouldn\u2019t b